```mermaid
flowchart TD
  subgraph Before
    S1[Watcher sweep finds a rejected check] --> W1[Wake: rejected unauthenticated state checks]
    W1 --> T1[Agent turn]
    T1 --> S1
  end
  subgraph After
    S2[Watcher sweep finds rejected checks] --> C{Same path, mode, and mtime set as last time?}
    C -->|yes| Q[No wake. Standing set stays in state/.rejected-checks]
    C -->|no| W2[One wake for the new set]
    W2 --> R[Record the new set]
    Q --> D[Session start prints REJECTED STATE CHECKS]
    R --> D
    G[Rejected files gone] --> X[Record cleared. No standing section]
  end
```
